  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peace and Stabilisation Programme Ukraine &amp; Moldova - Centre for Humanitarian Dialogue (CHD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project in Ukraine is to contribute to the furthering of a peace process, including Ukraine&#x2019;s Peace Formula and towards a holistic approach to social cohesion. Main component of the activity is advisory services on peace processes and social cohesion.

Likewise, in Moldova the objective is to contribute to conflict management through mediation and backchanneling, and planning for a comprehensive settlement of the Transnistria conflict.

Centre for Humanitarian Dialogue is implementing partner.</narrative>
  </description>
